# Vendored third-party crate sources are committed in full and must build
# offline. The secrets/build-artifact rules above (and any global excludes,
# e.g. *.o) must not strip their fixtures and pregenerated objects — ring's
# pregenerated *.o, *.pem/*.png test fixtures, etc.
!vendor/**%